      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Sharded Indexer + Sharded 主 KV (默认全切分)\n  Indexer Cache 与主 KV 均按相同 DCP Token Owner 切分 (1/DCP)\n  各卡选出本地候选 [T, 1, K_local] → Triton 基数排序跨卡归并 Top-K",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sfa_shd",
      "originalText": "• Sharded Indexer + Sharded 主 KV (默认全切分)\n  Indexer Cache 与主 KV 均按相同 DCP Token Owner 切分 (1/DCP)\n  各卡选出本地候选 [T, 1, K_local] → Triton 基数排序跨卡归并 Top-K",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
