      "updated": 1732360000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Replicated Indexer + Sharded 主 KV (压缩 Indexer 优化)\n  当 Indexer 采用高倍池化压缩 (如 4:1 KPool) 时，Indexer Cache 可全卡复制\n  零通信直出全局 Top-K；Prefill 写完主 KV 后按紧凑块表 AllGather 活跃 KV 块",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sfa_rep",
      "originalText": "• Replicated Indexer + Sharded 主 KV (压缩 Indexer 优化)\n  当 Indexer 采用高倍池化压缩 (如 4:1 KPool) 时，Indexer Cache 可全卡复制\n  零通信直出全局 Top-K；Prefill 写完主 KV 后按紧凑块表 AllGather 活跃 KV 块",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
